  "id": "USN-8997-1",
  "summary": "net-snmp vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that Net-SNMP incorrectly handled newly accepted\nconnections in the SMUX module. An unauthenticated remote attacker could\npossibly use this issue to cause Net-SNMP to block indefinitely,\nresulting in a denial of service.",
